<title>GREECE: Michaniki sees 25 pct 1996 earnings growth.</title>
<headline>Michaniki sees 25 pct 1996 earnings growth.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek construction firm Michaniki expects to post earnings growth of 25.5 percent in 1996 with pretax profit reaching 5.1 billion drachmas, its chief financial officer told Reuters.</p>
<p>He said pretax profit is expected to advance 39 percent to 7.1 billion drachmas in 1997.</p>
</text>
